  "sha256": "1f75f4676f21162ab0c7abf8e0dc0e4fe94d0f7bfe8fceb10c4d727c2a3ce5c4",
  "segments": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "text": "大家好，我是林知夏，欢迎来我的宿舍坐一会儿。",
      "start_seconds": 0.15,
      "end_seconds": 3.62,
      "original_audio": "audio\\o07-s01.wav",
      "tts_wall_seconds": 4.027548900005058
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "这次我们用同样的声音，比较不同模型的嘴部效果。",
      "start_seconds": 3.8400000000000003,
      "end_seconds": 7.61,
      "original_audio": "audio\\o07-s02.wav",
      "tts_wall_seconds": 2.468594000005396
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "爸爸妈妈准备了八杯冰水，别忘了慢慢喝。",
      "start_seconds": 7.83,
      "end_seconds": 11.02,
      "original_audio": "audio\\o07-s03.wav",
      "tts_wall_seconds": 2.3981337000004714
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "小熊吹泡泡，葡萄和苹果放在白色盘子里。",
      "start_seconds": 11.24,
      "end_seconds": 14.34,
      "original_audio": "audio\\o07-s04.wav",
      "tts_wall_seconds": 2.476579900001525
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "遇到复杂的事情，先把它拆成几个小步骤。",
      "start_seconds": 14.56,
      "end_seconds": 17.62,
      "original_audio": "audio\\o07-s05.wav",
      "tts_wall_seconds": 2.384309299988672
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "text": "不要着急，我们可以一边思考，一边慢慢说明。",
      "start_seconds": 17.84,
      "end_seconds": 21.24,
      "original_audio": "audio\\o07-s06.wav",
      "tts_wall_seconds": 2.632311400011531
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "text": "你最近在看什么书，或者有什么喜欢的电影？",
      "start_seconds": 21.46,
      "end_seconds": 24.560000000000002,
      "original_audio": "audio\\o07-s07.wav",
      "tts_wall_seconds": 2.43379530000675
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "text": "嗯，我听见了。这个问题，确实值得认真想一想。",
      "start_seconds": 24.78,
      "end_seconds": 27.94,
      "original_audio": "audio\\o07-s08.wav",
      "tts_wall_seconds": 2.4478145000030054
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "text": "谢谢你的陪伴，也谢谢每一条真诚的留言。",
      "start_seconds": 28.16,
      "end_seconds": 31.28,
      "original_audio": "audio\\o07-s09.wav",
      "tts_wall_seconds": 2.423456199991051
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "text": "今天先聊到这里，记得休息，我们下次再见。",
      "start_seconds": 31.5,
      "end_seconds": 34.74,
      "original_audio": "audio\\o07-s10.wav",
      "tts_wall_seconds": 2.4429453000047943
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "text": "微风吹过窗边，桌上的绿植轻轻摇晃。",
      "start_seconds": 34.96,
      "end_seconds": 37.81,
      "original_audio": "audio\\o07-s11.wav",
      "tts_wall_seconds": 2.342053100001067
    },
    {
      "id": 12,
      "text": "不必每一步都很完美，保持自己的节奏就好。",
      "start_seconds": 38.03,
      "end_seconds": 41.300000000000004,
      "original_audio": "audio\\o07-s12.wav",
      "tts_wall_seconds": 2.3731709999992745
    },
    {
      "id": 13,
      "text": "我们再把数字读一遍，一二三四五六七八九十。",
      "start_seconds": 41.52,
      "end_seconds": 45.09,
      "original_audio": "audio\\o07-s13.wav",
      "tts_wall_seconds": 2.8078753000008874
    },
    {
      "id": 14,
      "text": "闭上嘴巴，然后轻轻呼气。现在放松肩膀，再继续说话。",
      "start_seconds": 45.31,
      "end_seconds": 49.25,
      "original_audio": "audio\\o07-s14.wav",
      "tts_wall_seconds": 2.628419300002861
    },
    {
      "id": 15,
      "text": "苹果、葡萄、泡泡和白纸，这几个词的嘴形各不相同。",
      "start_seconds": 49.47,
      "end_seconds": 53.17,
      "original_audio": "audio\\o07-s15.wav",
      "tts_wall_seconds": 2.5871776999993017
    },
    {
      "id": 16,
      "text": "说到这里稍微停一下。好了，我们接着看下一段画面。",
      "start_seconds": 53.39,
      "end_seconds": 57.35,
      "original_audio": "audio\\o07-s16.wav",
      "tts_wall_seconds": 2.5853157000092324
    }
  ],
